  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Adjust pH to 7.4 with 8 M NaOH"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Prepare the medium anaerobically under 100% nitrogen. Cellobiose, NaHCO3, and cysteine-HCl are sterilized separately by autoclaving under N2. For aerobic growth, omit resazurin and cysteine-HCl."
    }
